has numbers with Length is 3 and value.Bits is 32
constant Zero = Vector3(0, 0, 0)
constant One = Vector3(1, 1, 1)
constant UnitX = Vector3(1, 0, 0)
constant UnitY = Vector3(0, 1, 0)
constant UnitZ = Vector3(0, 0, 1)
X Number
	Vector3(1, 2, 3).X is 1
	numbers.X
Y Number
	Vector3(1, 2, 3).Y is 2
	numbers.Y
Z Number
	Vector3(1, 2, 3).Z is 3
	numbers.Z
Length Number
	Vector3(2, 3, 6).Length is 7
	(X * X + Y * Y + Z * Z).SquareRoot
+(other) Vector3
	Vector3(1, 2, 3) + Vector3.One is Vector3(2, 3, 4)
	Vector3(X + other.X, Y + other.Y, Z + other.Z)
-(other) Vector3
	Vector3(4, 7, 9) - Vector3(1, 2, 3) is Vector3(3, 5, 6)
	Vector3(X - other.X, Y - other.Y, Z - other.Z)
*(other) Number
	Vector3(1, 2, 3) * Vector3(4, 5, 6) is 32
	X * other.X + Y * other.Y + Z * other.Z
*(scale Number) Vector3
	Vector3(1, 2, 3) * 2 is Vector3(2, 4, 6)
	Vector3(X * scale, Y * scale, Z * scale)
/(scale Number) Vector3
	Vector3(2, 4, 6) / 2 is Vector3(1, 2, 3)
	Vector3(X / scale, Y / scale, Z / scale)
Cross(other) Vector3
	Vector3.UnitX.Cross(Vector3.UnitY) is Vector3.UnitZ
	Vector3.UnitY.Cross(Vector3.UnitX) is Vector3(0, 0, -1)
	Vector3(Y * other.Z - Z * other.Y, Z * other.X - X * other.Z, X * other.Y - Y * other.X)
Normalize Vector3
	Vector3(3, 0, 4).Normalize is Vector3(0.6, 0, 0.8)
	Vector3.Zero.Normalize is Vector3.Zero
	Length > 0 then value / Length else value
DistanceTo(other) Number
	Vector3(1, 2, 3).DistanceTo(Vector3(3, 5, 9)) is 7
	(value - other).Length
Lerp(other, alpha Number) Vector3
	Vector3(0, 2, 4).Lerp(Vector3(4, 6, 8), 0.25) is Vector3(1, 3, 5)
	value + (other - value) * alpha
Flat Vector2
	Vector3(1, 2, 3).Flat is Vector2(1, 2)
	Vector2(X, Y)